From bf438191781ec791e7b011ec95476e7a5e0fe442 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Link Dupont <link@sub-pop.net>
Date: Mon, 18 Aug 2025 12:43:13 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add D-Bus interface authorization

This commit introduces a new `DBusAuthorizationMixin` class that provides authorization functionality for D-Bus interfaces. The mixin is integrated into the `UserInterface`, `ChatInterface`, and `HistoryInterface`, ensuring that caller authorization is verified for various method calls.
